Dear brothers in arms,

We are pleased to announce our first update after the release!

[list]
[*]Soldiers in the camp are automatically sorted by experience;
[*]Added soldier class icons;
[*]Added toggle for cinematic camera;
[*]Added support for custom localization;
[*]Music is not ending abruptly;
[*]Fixed many typos and minor errors;
[/list]

[img]http://images.akamai.steamusercontent.com/ugc/1621679306996940744/D219DB4300D5DD86F37F3F977F90EE7D4CBDB81B/[/img]

Many thanks for your feedback and bug reports, they are helping us to develop the game.

Bretwalda Games

